  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>復古RPG字型</strong></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">介紹</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">這款易於閱讀的復古RPG風格字型，將進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗。專為<a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a>模組包設計，但現已對大眾開放！<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">基於Daymarius的<a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.fontriver.com%252ffont%252fretro_gaming%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Retro Gaming</a>字型。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">此字型採用免費字型許可證。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/769/583/retro-rpg-font.PNG\" width=\"1078\" height=\"485\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>螢幕截圖</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/769/585/2023-12-05_12.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/769/586/2023-12-05_12.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/769/584/2023-12-05_12.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"&quot;1080\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即獲取伺服器，與朋友一起遊玩！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，並使用代碼<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>可享25%折扣！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media